        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 10:30",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 10,
        "verse": 30
      },
      {
        "text": "And said, Cornelius, thy prayer is heard, and thine alms are had in remembrance in the sight of God.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 31,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 10:31",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 10,
        "verse": 31
      },
      {
        "text": "Send therefore to Joppa, and call hither Simon, whose surname is Peter; he is lodged in the house of one Simon a tanner by the sea side: who, when he cometh, shall speak unto thee.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 101,
            "end": 104
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 32,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 10:32",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 10,
        "verse": 32
      },
      {
        "text": "Immediately therefore I sent to thee; and thou hast well done that thou art come. Now therefore are we all here present before God, to hear all things that are commanded thee of God.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 33,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 10:33",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 10,
        "verse": 33
      },
      {
        "text": "Then Peter opened his mouth, and said, Of a truth I perceive that God is no respecter of persons:",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 76,
            "end": 85,
            "text": "Acts 15:9; 17:26 (25–26); Rom. 2:11; 1 Ne. 17:35; D&C 1:35; 38:16. TG Judgment."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 18,
            "end": 21
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 34,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 10:34",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 10,
        "verse": 34
      },
      {
